@startuml
!theme sunlust

class Singleton {
    - {static} instance : Singleton*
    - {static} mutex : mutex
    - value : string
    - Singleton()
    - Singleton(Singleton&)
    - operator=(Singleton&)
    + {static} getInstance() : Singleton&
    + businessLogic() : void
    + getValue() : string
    + setValue(string) : void
}

note right of Singleton
    Private constructor prevents
    direct instantiation.
    
    Static getInstance() provides
    global access point.
    
    Copy constructor and assignment
    operator are deleted.
end note

class Client1 {
}

class Client2 {
}

class Client3 {
}

Client1 ..> Singleton : uses
Client2 ..> Singleton : uses
Client3 ..> Singleton : uses

note bottom of Client1
    All clients access the
    same singleton instance
    through getInstance()
end note

@enduml